        "bodyHtml": "Karma empowers her next Ability used within 8 seconds.<br /><span><span>Inner Flame</span>: Deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/100/160/220 + (30% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and leaves behind a circle of flame, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies and dealing an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/130/220/310 + (50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<span><span>Focused Resolve</span>: Karma will restore <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(17% + (0.01% Ability Power)) missing Health</span> at the beginning and end of the tether, and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Root</span> for 0.5/0.75/1/1.25s longer.<span><span>Inspire</span>: Karma shields her target for <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(45/85/125/165 + (45% Ability Power)) more Shield</span>, and also shields allies near her target, granting them <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(45/85/125/165 + (45% Ability Power)) Shield</span> and <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">15% Move Speed</span>.",
